  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is moving in a circle at constant speed. The time period of the particles rotation is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> and its kinetic energy is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>. What is the radius of the particle’s path?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{E T}{2 \\pi^{2} m}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{E T^{2}}{2 \\pi^{2} m}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{E T}{4 \\pi^{2} m}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{E T^{2}}{4 \\pi^{2} m}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
